_6Nl5D Reveal_directionUp__lQZck"><article class="page_processStep__JaWVI"><b>01</b><h3>調査・企画</h3><p>設置候補地、系統連系、用途、電力市場の活用方針を整理します。</p></article></div><div class="Reveal_root__6Nl5D Reveal_directionUp__lQZck" style="--reveal-delay:70ms"><article class="page_processStep__JaWVI"><b>02</b><h3>システム設計</h3><p>ESS、PCS、EMS、変圧設備、通信構成を要件に合わせて設計します。</p></article></div><div class="Reveal_root__6Nl5D Reveal_directionUp__lQZck" style="--reveal-delay:140ms"><article class="page_processStep__JaWVI"><b>03</b><h3>調達・施工</h3><p>機器調達、据付、電気工事、試運転、連系手続きを進めます。</p></article></div><div class="Reveal_root__6Nl5D Reveal_directionUp__lQZck" style="--reveal-delay:210ms"><article class="page_processStep__JaWVI"><b>04</b><h3>運用・保守</h3><p>遠隔監視、予兆保全、一次調整力対応、市場活用まで継続的に支援します。</p></article></div></div></div></section><section class="page_cta__YDY49" aria-labelledby="battery-cta-title"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="page_ctaImage__fYwKU" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="<?php echo NOAH_ASSETS; ?>/battery/utility-installation.png"/><div class="container page_ctaInner__Dt6Kr"><div class="Reveal_root__6Nl5D Reveal_directionUp__lQZck"><h2 id="battery-cta-title">系統用蓄電池・産業用蓄電池の<br/>導入相談はこちら</h2><p>事業計画の初期段階から、候補地・容量・運用モデルまでご相談ください。</p><div class="page_ctaActions__wh8WL"><a class="Button_button__f_l0m Button_white__ysOC9" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>contact/">お問い合わせ<span aria-hidden="true" class="Button_arrow__cvrDP">→</span></a></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="Footer_footer__rZB2Q" id="company"><div class="container"><div class="Footer_grid__G4Mer"><a class="Footer_logo__Rbx6w" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>"><img src="<?php echo NOAH_ASSETS; ?>/noah_logo.png" alt="諾亜建設株式会社"/></a><div class="Footer_links__6wOW9"><div class="Footer_linkGroup__TGFkU"><h3><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>about/">企業情報</a></h3><a class="Foot